+# VeilLink 29.0 · Build 66
+
+V29 unifies the post-V28 functional development, not only Veilopoly UI.
+
+- Veilopoly: live two-human + two-AI room integration; offline deterministic
+  rules, full turn/property/auction/trade/building/card/finance/stock systems;
+  V5 fictional economy and bank-liquidity/claim/estate handling; previous V4
+  and classic saves remain versioned. No real money or exchangeable rewards.
+- Movable/suspendable native panels, pinned decision buttons, independent
+  read-only asset browsing, keyboard-safe numeric drafts, improved themes,
+  complete searchable manual + bundled player guide and original Kimi/Astra art.
+- Gomoku/Xiangqi R3–R8 trained/tactical refinements, compact board-first controls
+  and user-controlled deep search defaulting on, independent of device label.
+- Experimental offline LingCore Vertex35M chat: real pinned29,203,168-byte GGUF
+  and iOS15 native llama runtime; text-only and zero tool/game/DB authority.
+  **中文能力尚未通过验证。** Model may answer incorrectly or in another language.
+  This is experimental, NOT a reliable translator or device/game controller.
+- Remaining new Inbox file-import/hash cancellation propagation; prior V28
+  features retained, not overwritten by old proposal snapshots. Overlapping
+  branch variants are reconciled once; source evidence branches remain intact.
+
+Candidate evidence: Linux Swift6.2.1 full Veilopoly368/368 PASS; real model
+bytes/hash/GGUF-v3 PASS; portable resource verifier5/5 and model gate7/7 PASS.
+These are NOT physical-device results. Apple build/XCTest, native inference,
+device app and actual IPA model/framework/resource parity must succeed before
